      >

      <p class="provenance">
        <span>
          Counts read from <code>{CANONICAL_BASE}/ui</code> and <code>/rs/&lt;name&gt;</code>, and crates.io checked, when this page was built,{" "}
          <time datetime={builtAt}>{builtAt}</time>.
        </span>
        <a href={`${CANONICAL_BASE}/ui`}>Read the JSON</a>
